       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVISORCOUNT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9(5) VALUE 360.
       01 DIVISOR PIC 9(5).
       01 DIVISOR-TOTAL PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING DIVISOR FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL DIVISOR > N
               IF FUNCTION MOD(N, DIVISOR) = 0
                   ADD 1 TO DIVISOR-TOTAL
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM

           DISPLAY N " HAS " DIVISOR-TOTAL " DIVISORS"
           STOP RUN.
